<!-- OVERVIEW: one passage; its words darken as it is read, the shield   -->
<!-- closes when the reader reaches the end                              -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s1-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story" data-lit>
      <h2 class="story__title rv" id="s1-title">Cybersecurity Solutions for Startups Building Secure Digital Products</h2>

      <div class="story__aside" aria-hidden="true">
        {{ icon("rocket", "lg") }}
        <span class="story__rail"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="story__body">
        <p>CipherTrivia works with startups to identify security weaknesses that can emerge during product development and business expansion. From SaaS platforms and customer-facing applications to cloud infrastructure and third-party APIs, we assess the digital assets that support your business and uncover vulnerabilities that could expose sensitive data or compromise critical operations.</p>
        <p>Our cyber security services for startups focus on practical security testing that fits the technical demands of early-stage and growing businesses. Through penetration testing and vulnerability assessments alongside web application security and API testing or cloud security reviews, we help teams discover exploitable flaws and understand their potential business impact.</p>
        <p>Building security into your product early can reduce remediation costs and support customer trust. CipherTrivia delivers clear technical findings and prioritized recommendations that help startup teams address security gaps without losing sight of product development goals. From MVP launches to scaling SaaS platforms, our cyber security solutions for startups support informed decisions about application security and infrastructure protection as your business evolves.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

