<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s5-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="ihead">
      <h2 class="ihead__title rv" id="s5-title">Compliance Frameworks We Help Startups Address</h2>
      <p class="ihead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Startups pursuing enterprise customers or entering regulated markets often need to demonstrate strong security practices and responsible data handling. CipherTrivia helps identify gaps in technical security controls through cyber security services for startups that support compliance preparation and customer security assessments.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fw-grid fw-grid--7">
      <article class="fw rv">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("badge") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">ISO 27001</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">ISO/IEC 27001</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We assess information security controls and risk management practices to identify gaps in protecting business data and supporting an effective Information Security Management System (ISMS).</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("shield-check") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">SOC 2</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">SOC 2</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We review relevant security controls involving access management and data protection to help SaaS startups and technology providers prepare for SOC 2 examinations.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("user-shield") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">GDPR</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">GDPR</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We assess relevant technical safeguards and access controls for startups processing personal data within the scope of the General Data Protection Regulation.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("card") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">PCI DSS</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">PCI DSS</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">For startups that store or process payment card data, we assess relevant security controls to identify gaps in protecting cardholder information and payment environments.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("radar") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">NIST</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">NIST Cybersecurity Framework</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We evaluate cybersecurity practices across asset management and protection alongside threat detection and response to help startups identify security improvement priorities.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("eye-off") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">DPDP</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDP Act), India</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">We review relevant technical safeguards and data security practices that support compliance efforts for startups processing digital personal data under applicable Indian requirements.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("health-record") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">HIPAA</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">HIPAA</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">For startups developing healthcare applications or handling protected health information on behalf of covered entities or business associates, we assess relevant security controls against applicable HIPAA requirements.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

